[I] Hatch plugin for versioning with your preferred VCS

[T] hatch-vcs is a plugin for the Hatch Python project manager and its
[T] Hatchling build backend that uses a version control system like Git to
[T] determine project versions. It is based on setuptools-scm and can also
[T] write the version to a file at build time.

[U] https://pypi.org/project/hatch-vcs/

